+// This holds for staged sessions too. Every stage owns the recurrent state and
+// attention KV of its own layers in its own context, receives the same trim
+// position as every other stage, and rolls back only what it decoded itself;
+// nothing is restored across hosts. Stages may size their snapshot depth
